  "summary": {
    "text": "Claude Opus 4.1 is a language model in Anthropic's Opus line, offered to paid Claude users, in Claude Code, on the Anthropic API, Amazon Bedrock and Google Cloud Vertex AI at the same price as Claude Opus 4. Anthropic calls it an incremental update to Opus 4 and deployed it under the same ASL-3 Standard.",
